'''Cassian's Yavin home''' was the residence of [[Alliance to Restore the Republic]] [[Captain]] [[Cassian Jeron Andor|Cassian Andor]] on the [[moon]] [[Yavin 4]], where he lived with his lover [[Bix Caleen]] in the home.<ref name="AndorWorldBuilding" /> After her departure from Yavin,<ref name="Welcome">{{Andor|Welcome to the Rebellion}}</ref> [[K-2SO]] and [[Ruescott Melshi]] lived with Andor in the house, creating a more disorganized environment.<ref name="AndorWorldBuilding" />

